\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec3 e_os  Intelligent Elevator Operating System\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\fs24 \cf2 \strokec3 e_os is an intelligent elevator dispatch and optimization system designed to enhance passenger service through adaptive algorithms, AI-driven analysis, and continuous improvement.
\f1\b0 \cf2 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs28 \cf2 \strokec3 AI-Driven Optimization\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf2 \strokec3 At the heart of e_os is a dedicated AI agent that enters a nightly 
\f0\b \cf2 \strokec3 Dream Phase
\f1\b0 \cf2 \strokec3 , analyzing operational data, evaluating dispatch strategies, and optimizing performance. When traffic patterns change or service quality deviates from defined targets, the system can initiate further optimization to adapt.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs28 \cf2 \strokec3 Adaptive Traffic Management\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf2 \strokec3 e_os combines embedded weekly time-pattern memory with local reinforcement learning to recognize passenger traffic throughout the day. By identifying recurring patterns and changing demand, the system dynamically adjusts dispatch strategies to improve elevator service.\
Through an intelligent chatbot, building managers can issue operational commands and define management scenarios. The system translates these instructions into dispatch policies and applies them to the service plan.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs28 \cf2 \strokec3 Intelligent Parking Management\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf2 \strokec3 e_os incorporates static and dynamic parking modules, supported by a dedicated database that tracks floor occupancy and parking behavior. By analyzing building activity, the system optimizes elevator parking positions to improve availability and reduce unnecessary travel.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs28 \cf2 \strokec3 Passenger Service Optimization\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf2 \strokec3 The e_os performance engine balances 
\f0\b \cf2 \strokec3 passenger waiting time and time to destination
\f1\b0 \cf2 \strokec3 . Rather than optimizing a single metric, it evaluates overall service quality to deliver a more efficient passenger experience.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs28 \cf2 \strokec3 Connected Intelligence and Simulation\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf2 \strokec3 Equipped with Wi-Fi and Bluetooth, e_os supports connectivity with external systems and online AI-assisted optimization where internet access is available.\
During the Dream Phase, the intelligent agent simulates alternative service strategies using recorded traffic data. By evaluating candidate scenarios across different traffic conditions, the system aims to identify effective dispatch policies for both recurring and changing demand.\
